      "created_at": "2016-08-09T05:39:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>Man, Baron Blade got a godly reshuffle on his flip in my game.&nbsp; He got early Hasten Doom and \"Consider the Price of Victory!\" plays in, meaning he was about to start hitting me for 8 damage per turn.&nbsp; My recently technologically inferior heroes wouldn't have lasted long, but thankfully, neither did the Baron.</p>",
