      "created_at": "2016-08-09T05:41:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mint. &nbsp;I got lucky enough to Hypersonic Assault the Baron on the turn before he played Devious Disruption. &nbsp;Without his nuke he went down easy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Same. Having each hero always pick the most-damaging play* tends to make Mad Bomber go down quickly; dodging the Disruption was just icing on the cake. Won during the start phase of AZ's 5th turn with all heroes' HP in the mid-to-high teens.</p>\n<p>*Except in one case where skipping Tachyon's last play led to the T-Rex biting Blade for 6.</p>",
